1
00:00:02,168 --> 00:00:04,088
NARRATOR:
Previously on The Big Bang Theory:

2
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:07,754
I'm going to the Arctic Circle with
Leonard, Wolowitz and Koothrappali.

3
00:00:07,924 --> 00:00:09,844
-For three months?
-Yes.

4
00:00:10,176 --> 00:00:13,426
What did you mean when you said
you were going to miss me?

5
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,140
[SIGHS]

6
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:17,976
It means I wish you weren't going.

7
00:00:31,948 --> 00:00:33,528
(Leonard:)Oh, thank God we're home.

8
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:37,700
(Howard:)I can't believe we spent three months
in that frozen hell.

9
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:41,371
(Raj:)It was like a snowy nightmare
from which there was no awakening.

10
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:44,458
(Sheldon:)I don't know what Arctic expedition
you were on...

11
00:00:44,627 --> 00:00:46,627
(Sheldon:)...I thought it was a hoot and a half.

12
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:51,845
(Sheldon:)Oh, hi, Mom.

13
00:00:52,177 --> 00:00:55,217
(Sheldon:)No. I told you I'd call you when I got home.
I'm not home yet.

14
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:59,095
All right. I'm home.

15
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:02,189
(Sheldon:)The Arctic expedition
was a remarkable success.

